# Save the Children (battlefield.save_the_children): the zone at capacity, LOCKED, and a menu outliving its fight.
# Four level 75 Warriors of San d'Oria by Hut_Door: main and bob with 1-3 current at Status 2 (two registrants, not
# in one party), cid and eve with 1-3 completed (helpers; GMs set the statuses). main leads cid and eve. main's
# menu, area 1: registered, cid and eve registered with it; main enters. bob, alone, no member holding a clearance:
# getBattlefieldOptions: bob meets the requirement, but battlefieldAtCapacity holds (Ghelsba Outpost has one arena,
# taken): no option: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY. (So registerBattlefield's INCREMENT_REQUEST for the fixed area can not
# be asked here; rank_2_mission_2#busy takes it.) cid and eve, holding the clearance: completed: the menu
# (enterExisting 1); neither updates yet. main claims a Fodderchief: its enmity locks the battlefield;
# onBattlefieldStatusChange (LOCKED, once) takes the clearance from cid and eve, outside it (0x029 206 for each).
# cid's update: registerBattlefield: no clearance and no effect, [BCNM]EnterExisting 1, cid still registered in
# area 1, the area asked: LOCKED (0x05C [4]). The three killed: won, 32001 to main; finished; the cleanup ends the
# battlefield (no registration left). eve's update now: EnterExisting 1, registered nowhere: REQS_NOT_MET (0x05C
# [5]); that arm's delStatusEffect(BATTLEFIELD) deletes nothing (the lock took eve's clearance). No timing or RNG
# dependency; the tick sizes are the ones the other Save the Children flows use.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cid zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
cid: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
cid: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
cid: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
eve: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
eve: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
eve: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
bob: login
bob: missionstatus Sandoria 2           # a GM
cid: login
eve: login
invite cid
cid: accept
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # registered in area 1; cid and eve registered with it
finish                                  # main entered
bob: trigger Hut_Door                   # the zone's one arena taken: at capacity: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
cid: trigger Hut_Door                   # the clearance, completed: the menu (enterExisting)
eve: trigger Hut_Door                   # the same
tick 2000                               # the Fodderchiefs spawn
claim FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK                # LOCKED; the clearance taken from cid and eve
tick 1000
cid: update 32000 option=1              # no clearance, still registered: LOCKED
cid: finish
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # won: 32001 to main
finish                                  # 1-3: the key, the title, Status 3
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # the battlefield gone
eve: update 32000 option=1              # registered nowhere: REQS_NOT_MET
eve: finish
